# Judge8-10-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:刚才亚里沙说过，<br>案发当时<br>【自己虽然在室外<br>但并没有淋到雨】<br>对吧？|#0203Trial10_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:没错。<br>所以我一个人都没碰见到。|#0203Trial10_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这有什么奇怪的？|#0203Trial10_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR17,ArmL12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:很奇怪！|#0203Trial10_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为事实上，<br>当晚就是下过雨！|#0203Trial10_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……啊！？|#0203Trial10_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我经过<br>中庭的时候<br>有看到在下雨哦。<br>下得可大了！|#0203Trial10_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你说什么……？|#0203Trial10_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:呃……<br>我印象中记得<br>当时确实下了雨。<br>虽然只下了一阵子……|#0203Trial10_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:诺亚也看到了哦～？|#0203Trial10_Noah001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:唔……！<br>可除我以外<br>不是还有人作证<br>当时没下雨吗！|#0203Trial10_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"没、没错！<br>那时候晾在外面的<br>衣服都<link=\"Objection_02_03_10_01\">晾干了</link>……！|#0203Trial10_Hanna001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但这不过是<br>收衣服的<br><link=\"Objection_02_03_10_02\">时间点问题</link>吧？<br>|#0203Trial10_Sherry005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR17,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那样的话<br>就跟下雨没有矛盾！|#0203Trial10_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而且实际上，<br>大家都确认过<br>中庭的地面是<br>一片泥泞……|#0203Trial10_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"【人在室外<br>却没有淋雨】，<br>亚里沙的这番证词<br>跟我看到的情景，<br>还有证据都有<link=\"Objection_02_03_10_03\">矛盾</link>！<br>|#0203Trial10_Sherry008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR17,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以真相就是<br>亚里沙在说谎！|#0203Trial10_Sherry009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open03
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你说什么……！？<br>我撒这种谎<br>有个屁用啊！|#0203Trial10_Alisa006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你想隐瞒当时<br>自己在什么地方，<br>肯定是这样！|#0203Trial10_Sherry010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:为了掩盖<br>杀害安安的事实……<br>亚里沙伪造了自己的行踪，<br>于是跟证词证据<br>产生了矛盾！|#0203Trial10_Sherry011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4



